        { "id": "prt_02c", "sessionID": "ses_102", "messageID": "msg_02", "type": "text", "text": "Not really - once you've pushed and someone else has pulled it, that branch is shared. Rebasing rewrites the commits (new hashes), so after you rebase and push, your history and Sarah's history for that branch will diverge. I'd merge main into your branch instead, or coordinate with her first if you really want to rebase." },
